stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> TODO: Created (6-digit numeric ID assigned, e.g. 619347)
    
    TODO --> IN_PROGRESS: Contributor starts work / Timer initiated
    IN_PROGRESS --> TODO: Paused / Blocked
    
    IN_PROGRESS --> CODE_REVIEW: Developer submits PR / requests review
    CODE_REVIEW --> IN_PROGRESS: Changes Requested by Reviewer
    
    CODE_REVIEW --> TESTING: Review Approved & Merged / Ready for QA
    TESTING --> IN_PROGRESS: Defect Found / Linked Bug (B-######) Raised
    
    TESTING --> DONE: QA Verified / Acceptance Criteria Passed
    DONE --> IN_PROGRESS: Reopened / Regression Reported
    DONE --> [*]: Sprint Iteration Closed
